(4822904, 698444, 15711, '<td valign="top">Almost a tribute to Magritte with a twist.  I like it.  Leaves the story up to our imagination. If I were to critique anything, I might have composed it so that they are less centered and are to one side maybe the left, with more neg space to the right, but that''s just my taste.</td>', 'Almost a tribute to Magritte with a twist.  I like it.  Leaves the story up to our imagination. If I were to critique anything, I might have composed it so that they are less centered and are to one side maybe the left, with more neg space to the right, but that''s just my taste.', '2008-07-14 01:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4822913, 698750, 77521, '<td valign="top">a little too much processing in my opinion.</td>', 'a little too much processing in my opinion.', '2008-07-14 01:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4822923, 698913, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m not a bird person but the focus is spot on.  I love that the background has a rainbow effect as well. My only complaint is the blur of the front bokeh - probably part of the tree upon which he is resting. 7</td>', 'I''m not a bird person but the focus is spot on.  I love that the background has a rainbow effect as well. My only complaint is the blur of the front bokeh - probably part of the tree upon which he is resting. 7', '2008-07-14 01:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
