(4823087, 698444, 75034, '<td valign="top">Coley is this you??? This is an absolutely fantastic shot and so powerful. You can feel him take a deep breath as he looks upon her. <br/> <br/>This shot is sheer genius, masterfully thought out, wonderfully composed, terrific set up, and beautifully executed.<br/> <br/>I can''t wait to hear how you came up with this one.<br/> <br/>In my favorites and scores a 10 form me, bravo, well done. <br/> <br/>I hope everyone sees this shot for how wonderful it is and if they do I know we''ll see this shot sporting a Blue and you a great BIG grin.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours, and all the best for this photo.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Coley is this you??? This is an absolutely fantastic shot and so powerful. You can feel him take a deep breath as he looks upon her.  This shot is sheer genius, masterfully thought out, wonderfully composed, terrific set up, and beautifully executed. I can''t wait to hear how you came up with this one. In my favorites and scores a 10 form me, bravo, well done.  I hope everyone sees this shot for how wonderful it is and if they do I know we''ll see this shot sporting a Blue and you a great BIG grin. All the best to you and yours, and all the best for this photo. MAX!', '2008-07-14 01:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
