(4823461, 698741, 68035, '<td valign="top">really intriguing image from the thumbnail amd then when you open it up, wow!!!<br/> <br/>Great idea and very well executed.  Incredibly strong black and white conversion.  My one minor (and I do mean minor) other comment would be that its a shame that the girl on the right seems slightly at an angle.  Still great shot and I hope this does well for you 9</td>', 'really intriguing image from the thumbnail amd then when you open it up, wow!!! Great idea and very well executed.  Incredibly strong black and white conversion.  My one minor (and I do mean minor) other comment would be that its a shame that the girl on the right seems slightly at an angle.  Still great shot and I hope this does well for you 9', '2008-07-14 06:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4823463, 698901, 68035, '<td valign="top">What is thi, it looks like a mushroom shot from below in water....Actually I dont care what it is because what I know is that it is a fantastic abstract and a pleasure to look at -9</td>', 'What is thi, it looks like a mushroom shot from below in water....Actually I dont care what it is because what I know is that it is a fantastic abstract and a pleasure to look at -9', '2008-07-14 06:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4823464, 698524, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very very nice candid.  I love the black and white conversion and the DOF is absolutely spot on, we can recognise what is in the background but it does not impinge on the power of the main subject.  Great job</td>', 'Very very nice candid.  I love the black and white conversion and the DOF is absolutely spot on, we can recognise what is in the background but it does not impinge on the power of the main subject.  Great job', '2008-07-14 06:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4823465, 698902, 68035, '<td valign="top">Tremendous animal shot with wonderful sharpness and great bokeh.  Shame that one of the whiskers appears to be cut off (sorry I realise that is very nit picky) but a brilliant image 9</td>', 'Tremendous animal shot with wonderful sharpness and great bokeh.  Shame that one of the whiskers appears to be cut off (sorry I realise that is very nit picky) but a brilliant image 9', '2008-07-14 06:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4823470, 696996, 77287, '<td valign="top">Really good image. I''d like to have seen the original crop as the line of wet hair cuts across the image. I wasn''t sure what it was at first. At first I thought it was perhaps a pipe carrying the water. Nice lighting too. 8</td>', 'Really good image. I''d like to have seen the original crop as the line of wet hair cuts across the image. I wasn''t sure what it was at first. At first I thought it was perhaps a pipe carrying the water. Nice lighting too. 8', '2008-07-14 06:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
