(4823748, 698615, 81362, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition. The tumbnail makes the paper appear to be flowing out of two pipes. Having the pages of one book darker than the other provides an interesting contrast. Love the originality.</td>', 'Stunning composition. The tumbnail makes the paper appear to be flowing out of two pipes. Having the pages of one book darker than the other provides an interesting contrast. Love the originality.', '2008-07-14 10:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4823749, 698679, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting old truck, but I''m finding the sky to be too blue and unrealistic.  Clouds should be white.  Hmmm...looking at this a little closer it looks like the sky was substantially processed.  An easier trick is to use a polarizer on your lens - that would make the truck a richer color, eliminate the window reflections (and other various items like the truck seat, etc...) - PLUS it can darken a sky and isolate clouds quite nicely.  Just a thought.  Good luck!</td>', 'Interesting old truck, but I''m finding the sky to be too blue and unrealistic.  Clouds should be white.  Hmmm...looking at this a little closer it looks like the sky was substantially processed.  An easier trick is to use a polarizer on your lens - that would make the truck a richer color, eliminate the window reflections (and other various items like the truck seat, etc...) - PLUS it can darken a sky and isolate clouds quite nicely.  Just a thought.  Good luck!', '2008-07-14 10:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
