(4825104, 698398, 91282, '<td valign="top">I wish the flamingo in the back was a little clearer, like the one in the foreground. The background (particularly the blueish stuff on the far left) is rather distracting, too. Beautiful subjects, though. I *love* how crisp the feather details are on the flamingo in the foreground.</td>', 'I wish the flamingo in the back was a little clearer, like the one in the foreground. The background (particularly the blueish stuff on the far left) is rather distracting, too. Beautiful subjects, though. I *love* how crisp the feather details are on the flamingo in the foreground.', '2008-07-14 21:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
