(4825111, 698940, 91282, '<td valign="top">This is probably one of my favorite close-up flower shots I''ve seen. I love the curl of the leaves, the crispness of the photo, and of course that gorgeous color!</td>', 'This is probably one of my favorite close-up flower shots I''ve seen. I love the curl of the leaves, the crispness of the photo, and of course that gorgeous color!', '2008-07-14 21:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
