(4825122, 697750, 91282, '<td valign="top">I love spider webs; They are really beautiful and interesting subjects, though they can be somewhat difficult to photograph.. Here, the top is pretty much lost in the sky/sun light, which is unfortunate since that''s half of the web. The background behind the web is blurry and distracting also, as is the wood of the door/window frame that the web is attached to. I think a better angle on this (maybe if you took it from a bit higher at kind of a downward-left angle? That might take care of some of the sun issue.) would make this picture much more interesting, and give more credit to the spider''s ''artwork'' as well.<br/> <br/>I do like the kind of rainbow effect of the sun on the web. It almost adds an element of ''magic'' to it, you know? :)</td>', 'I love spider webs; They are really beautiful and interesting subjects, though they can be somewhat difficult to photograph.. Here, the top is pretty much lost in the sky/sun light, which is unfortunate since that''s half of the web. The background behind the web is blurry and distracting also, as is the wood of the door/window frame that the web is attached to. I think a better angle on this (maybe if you took it from a bit higher at kind of a downward-left angle? That might take care of some of the sun issue.) would make this picture much more interesting, and give more credit to the spider''s ''artwork'' as well. I do like the kind of rainbow effect of the sun on the web. It almost adds an element of ''magic'' to it, you know? :)', '2008-07-14 21:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4825123, 697597, 26464, '<td valign="top">me too.</td>', 'me too.', '2008-07-14 21:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
