(4825135, 698109, 61818, '<td valign="top">This beautiful portrait is marred by what appears to be some poor masking showing up as a halo around her upper back.  That is really, really a drag because otherwise this is simply stunning.  Lighting is super, the model delivered an enticing pose and expression, and the blowing wisp of hair is the icing on the cake.</td>', 'This beautiful portrait is marred by what appears to be some poor masking showing up as a halo around her upper back.  That is really, really a drag because otherwise this is simply stunning.  Lighting is super, the model delivered an enticing pose and expression, and the blowing wisp of hair is the icing on the cake.', '2008-07-14 21:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
