(4825141, 697320, 91282, '<td valign="top">Wow! He''s certainly the center of attention, isn''t he? :) Really nice, crisp capture and great colors. I like that you got that neat-looking rock in the foreground too. I''m wondering if the background is just a *little* too blurry, though; It makes the fish look a little flat/two-dimensional to me. Regardless, I still really like this. I could definitely see this framed and hanging in my bathroom (which is done in bright colors and tropical-related stuff).</td>', 'Wow! He''s certainly the center of attention, isn''t he? :) Really nice, crisp capture and great colors. I like that you got that neat-looking rock in the foreground too. I''m wondering if the background is just a *little* too blurry, though; It makes the fish look a little flat/two-dimensional to me. Regardless, I still really like this. I could definitely see this framed and hanging in my bathroom (which is done in bright colors and tropical-related stuff).', '2008-07-14 21:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
