(4825700, 698654, 86799, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Pretty, soft and appealing.  The fingernails are a bit out of place I think.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Pretty, soft and appealing.  The fingernails are a bit out of place I think.', '2008-07-15 07:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4825701, 698654, 49109, '<td valign="top">I like the shooting angle, her expression and pose, although it makes her look a bit skinny. Don''t like the purple nails...<br/>Crop at right is quite unfortunate, lighting could also be improved.</td>', 'I like the shooting angle, her expression and pose, although it makes her look a bit skinny. Don''t like the purple nails...Crop at right is quite unfortunate, lighting could also be improved.', '2008-07-15 07:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
