(4825703, 698589, 94239, '<td valign="top">Cute. This makes me smile. And the still, cool peacefulness of ''nirvana'' are nicely depicted. I like the contrast of the happy flower against the kind of grim background.  Long crop is good but shouldn''t you be closer to the top? 8</td>', 'Cute. This makes me smile. And the still, cool peacefulness of ''nirvana'' are nicely depicted. I like the contrast of the happy flower against the kind of grim background.  Long crop is good but shouldn''t you be closer to the top? 8', '2008-07-15 07:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4825704, 698266, 94239, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. The eye of the moth really got my attention. 7</td>', 'Beautiful shot. The eye of the moth really got my attention. 7', '2008-07-15 07:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4825705, 698213, 49109, '<td valign="top">good pose and expression, very good lighting that shapes the muscles of her arm. her eye area seems a bit dark, probably due to the shadow of her cap, which sits too low</td>', 'good pose and expression, very good lighting that shapes the muscles of her arm. her eye area seems a bit dark, probably due to the shadow of her cap, which sits too low', '2008-07-15 07:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
