(4826287, 698396, 76598, '<td valign="top">Finding the perfect flower is important for this type image.  It is also important to look at other parts of the image and either use the other flowers to improve the image or delete them totally.  The parts of flowers showing distract from this one.  Also, an angle is often better than straight on for a flower photo</td>', 'Finding the perfect flower is important for this type image.  It is also important to look at other parts of the image and either use the other flowers to improve the image or delete them totally.  The parts of flowers showing distract from this one.  Also, an angle is often better than straight on for a flower photo', '2008-07-15 15:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826289, 698781, 76598, '<td valign="top">IMO...and not a criticism....the composition doesn''t appeal to me.  technically the photo is right on.</td>', 'IMO...and not a criticism....the composition doesn''t appeal to me.  technically the photo is right on.', '2008-07-15 15:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826290, 698887, 76598, '<td valign="top">There is an awful lot to like about the image.  My one criticism would be on something you probably couldn''t control....the angle of the middle bird isn''t optimal.</td>', 'There is an awful lot to like about the image.  My one criticism would be on something you probably couldn''t control....the angle of the middle bird isn''t optimal.', '2008-07-15 15:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826291, 697418, 76598, '<td valign="top">The focus seems soft on the bird....</td>', 'The focus seems soft on the bird....', '2008-07-15 15:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826293, 698561, 76598, '<td valign="top">....AND... I am not too sure how well it will do :)</td>', '....AND... I am not too sure how well it will do :)', '2008-07-15 15:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826297, 697503, 76598, '<td valign="top">Great image, beautiful lady, the image would have been better with more control of the light....later in the day when the sun was lower or waiting on clouds would have improved the image.</td>', 'Great image, beautiful lady, the image would have been better with more control of the light....later in the day when the sun was lower or waiting on clouds would have improved the image.', '2008-07-15 15:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826300, 698743, 76598, '<td valign="top">technically great image, however, I think the grass let you down.  A different background would have been better IMO.</td>', 'technically great image, however, I think the grass let you down.  A different background would have been better IMO.', '2008-07-15 15:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826304, 697654, 76598, '<td valign="top">The partial horse behind the foal doesn''t appeal to me.  A great mother/child shot or the newborn struggling alone shot would have been great...but this mixed composition doesn''t work IMO</td>', 'The partial horse behind the foal doesn''t appeal to me.  A great mother/child shot or the newborn struggling alone shot would have been great...but this mixed composition doesn''t work IMO', '2008-07-15 15:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826305, 698841, 76598, '<td valign="top">Nice, I would have liked a less busy background.</td>', 'Nice, I would have liked a less busy background.', '2008-07-15 15:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826334, 698534, 88718, '<td valign="top">Over did the vignette a bit but otherwise good shot</td>', 'Over did the vignette a bit but otherwise good shot', '2008-07-15 16:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826336, 697725, 88718, '<td valign="top">Love the movement in the wings</td>', 'Love the movement in the wings', '2008-07-15 16:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
