(4826345, 698522, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like the light behind her, IMO a wider f stop to blur the background more would have helped the image.</td>', 'I like the light behind her, IMO a wider f stop to blur the background more would have helped the image.', '2008-07-15 16:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
