(4826349, 698921, 76598, '<td valign="top">I think turning the eyes upward would really have improved this, as it is, it lacks interest IMO</td>', 'I think turning the eyes upward would really have improved this, as it is, it lacks interest IMO', '2008-07-15 16:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826353, 698047, 76598, '<td valign="top">Technically good photograph, but somehow the composition doesn''t say anything TO ME</td>', 'Technically good photograph, but somehow the composition doesn''t say anything TO ME', '2008-07-15 16:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826355, 697959, 76598, '<td valign="top">Good idea, consider cropping it tighter</td>', 'Good idea, consider cropping it tighter', '2008-07-15 16:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826356, 698852, 46097, '<td valign="top">Of the many photos of this type I''ve seen, this is certainly one of the best. It has lovely soft directional lighting, tack sharp focus, texture, in the baby and adult skin patterns and fingerprints, a "geometric" repeating pattern, with a focal point, and a lovely duotone that complements the whole mood.</td>', 'Of the many photos of this type I''ve seen, this is certainly one of the best. It has lovely soft directional lighting, tack sharp focus, texture, in the baby and adult skin patterns and fingerprints, a "geometric" repeating pattern, with a focal point, and a lovely duotone that complements the whole mood.', '2008-07-15 16:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826359, 698588, 24951, '<td valign="top">umm I think this would look better as a B&amp;W</td>', 'umm I think this would look better as a B&W', '2008-07-15 16:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826361, 698842, 76598, '<td valign="top">technically a good photograph, but it doesn''t grab and hold your attention</td>', 'technically a good photograph, but it doesn''t grab and hold your attention', '2008-07-15 16:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826362, 698895, 76598, '<td valign="top">If you get a second chance, trip a shallower depth of field to isolate the feeding, or even zoom in on that...this doesn''t "speak to me"</td>', 'If you get a second chance, trip a shallower depth of field to isolate the feeding, or even zoom in on that...this doesn''t "speak to me"', '2008-07-15 16:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4826365, 698890, 76598, '<td valign="top">It looks like the image was taken mid-day.  Waiting until the light was lower and warmer, or waiting on a cloud to pass over might have taken some of the hard contrast out of the image.</td>', 'It looks like the image was taken mid-day.  Waiting until the light was lower and warmer, or waiting on a cloud to pass over might have taken some of the hard contrast out of the image.', '2008-07-15 16:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
