(4826572, 698535, 73235, '<td valign="top">your pictures looks very inbalancing to me. the ''normal'' looking flower contrasting with the almost ''negative'' looking butterfly. I kept wondering back and forth between the two. You kept me discovering in your picture. Mission accomplished :)</td>', 'your pictures looks very inbalancing to me. the ''normal'' looking flower contrasting with the almost ''negative'' looking butterfly. I kept wondering back and forth between the two. You kept me discovering in your picture. Mission accomplished :)', '2008-07-15 17:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
