(4826594, 698475, 90658, '<td valign="top">Really has some wonderful qualities.  The lack of shading and definition between your model''s jawline and neck sort of makes her look a little alien-like.  Perhaps just another 1/2 second before hitting the shutter and this could have been alieviated.</td>', 'Really has some wonderful qualities.  The lack of shading and definition between your model''s jawline and neck sort of makes her look a little alien-like.  Perhaps just another 1/2 second before hitting the shutter and this could have been alieviated.', '2008-07-15 18:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
