(4832531, 698185, 74911, '<td valign="top">Good work Nilesh! I like the way you get the best out of the kit lenses. Thsi is good work on sharpness and composition. I am not sure how much does the background supports the portrait. But still a great portrait.</td>', 'Good work Nilesh! I like the way you get the best out of the kit lenses. Thsi is good work on sharpness and composition. I am not sure how much does the background supports the portrait. But still a great portrait.', '2008-07-18 14:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
