(4832535, 698471, 74911, '<td valign="top">Good timing. But the light is very harsh. The background is also distracting. I dont think you would have had much control on the background, though.</td>', 'Good timing. But the light is very harsh. The background is also distracting. I dont think you would have had much control on the background, though.', '2008-07-18 14:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
