(4832546, 698937, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors. I like the green everywhere. More sharpness would have made it a winner too. The brown thing at the left corner of the leaf is distracting to me.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors. I like the green everywhere. More sharpness would have made it a winner too. The brown thing at the left corner of the leaf is distracting to me.', '2008-07-18 14:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4832547, 698852, 74911, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! I can feel the softness of the little one''s hands. Your soft focus attempt is really successful with the theme. Great composition. I like the color. Overall a very pleasant shot worth seeing multiple times. Bravo!!</td>', 'Wow!!! I can feel the softness of the little one''s hands. Your soft focus attempt is really successful with the theme. Great composition. I like the color. Overall a very pleasant shot worth seeing multiple times. Bravo!!', '2008-07-18 14:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4832549, 698878, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Nice sky colors. Good one.</td>', 'Great perspective. Nice sky colors. Good one.', '2008-07-18 14:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4832552, 698752, 74911, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very harsh, that makes the image less pleasing. And also not sure you rested the flower on such a rough surface. Instead, I would have put it in a vase and viewed it from top to separate from the background. Here the details in the bottom surface is sharper than the flower itself. Hope you agree with my thoughts.</td>', 'The lighting is very harsh, that makes the image less pleasing. And also not sure you rested the flower on such a rough surface. Instead, I would have put it in a vase and viewed it from top to separate from the background. Here the details in the bottom surface is sharper than the flower itself. Hope you agree with my thoughts.', '2008-07-18 14:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4832553, 698614, 74911, '<td valign="top">Really golden... Great details... good work...</td>', 'Really golden... Great details... good work...', '2008-07-18 14:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4832555, 698665, 74911, '<td valign="top">May be, to be a great subject for macro shooters ;)<br/> <br/>I like the detailes on the fly and its shadow. I am not very sure if the upper half of the image is helping the image in anyway.</td>', 'May be, to be a great subject for macro shooters ;) I like the detailes on the fly and its shadow. I am not very sure if the upper half of the image is helping the image in anyway.', '2008-07-18 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
