(4832569, 696311, 74911, '<td valign="top">Very good lighitng. Nice details and sharpness. To get that DOF for a macro shot, you would have required a lot of light I guess. Good work.</td>', 'Very good lighitng. Nice details and sharpness. To get that DOF for a macro shot, you would have required a lot of light I guess. Good work.', '2008-07-18 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
