(4832751, 698628, 50695, '<td valign="top">What a strange, perfect moment. Every silly detail seems to mean anything. The positions of mother and child are as eternal as the position of the statue. The boy''s casual gesture registers as a mythic pose of aspiration or simply need. I''m awarding you my Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>I won''t be around on Monday, so maybe you could announce your victory yourself on the Posthumous Ribbons thread?</td>', 'What a strange, perfect moment. Every silly detail seems to mean anything. The positions of mother and child are as eternal as the position of the statue. The boy''s casual gesture registers as a mythic pose of aspiration or simply need. I''m awarding you my Posthumous Blue Ribbon.   I won''t be around on Monday, so maybe you could announce your victory yourself on the Posthumous Ribbons thread?', '2008-07-18 17:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4832754, 698668, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen such a breathtaking beam of light. I gave the blue to a candid shot of weirdness, but this gets the red for a carefully constructed shot of weirdness. In both cases, the magic happens. In spades.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>I won''t be around on Monday, so maybe you could announce your victory yourself on the Posthumous Ribbons thread?<br/> <br/>p.s. I hope this means that Silverfoxx is back!!</td>', 'I''ve never seen such a breathtaking beam of light. I gave the blue to a candid shot of weirdness, but this gets the red for a carefully constructed shot of weirdness. In both cases, the magic happens. In spades.   I won''t be around on Monday, so maybe you could announce your victory yourself on the Posthumous Ribbons thread? p.s. I hope this means that Silverfoxx is back!!', '2008-07-18 17:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
