(4832959, 698355, 89723, '<td valign="top">Nice work with the lighting. Excellent composition. I like how the individual is standing and admiring the aircraft. It''s like he was the pilot of it and is saying goodbye to it and the lady (his wife?)behind him is waiting patiently just watching him. <br/> <br/>I have been in the US Marines for the last nineteen years and have been married to a wonderful women for 13 of those years and have been deployed on numerous occasions. This picture is reminder to me of the sacrifice and steadfast support she always gives me. <br/> <br/>A favorite!<br/>Thanks 10</td>', 'Nice work with the lighting. Excellent composition. I like how the individual is standing and admiring the aircraft. It''s like he was the pilot of it and is saying goodbye to it and the lady (his wife?)behind him is waiting patiently just watching him.  I have been in the US Marines for the last nineteen years and have been married to a wonderful women for 13 of those years and have been deployed on numerous occasions. This picture is reminder to me of the sacrifice and steadfast support she always gives me.  A favorite!Thanks 10', '2008-07-18 19:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
