(4833313, 698666, 75034, '<td valign="top">Jason, this a powerful statement and I do hope people get your point, if they don''t their missing out on a fantastically telling image. You have captured a fantastic and difficult emotion to convey and you have done a great job of it. Your lighting and composition are terrific and the DoF is spot on. You have a lot to be proud of with this shot. I find it difficult to photograph myself (noted by the lack of SP''s in my portfolio) but may you can it done and done well. Good on you mate and I do hope you do well in this one. I should hope to see this one in the top 10!!<br/> <br/>10 from me mate and a well deserved one at that:)<br/> <br/>All the best with the challenge.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Jason, this a powerful statement and I do hope people get your point, if they don''t their missing out on a fantastically telling image. You have captured a fantastic and difficult emotion to convey and you have done a great job of it. Your lighting and composition are terrific and the DoF is spot on. You have a lot to be proud of with this shot. I find it difficult to photograph myself (noted by the lack of SP''s in my portfolio) but may you can it done and done well. Good on you mate and I do hope you do well in this one. I should hope to see this one in the top 10!! 10 from me mate and a well deserved one at that:) All the best with the challenge. MAX!', '2008-07-19 01:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
