(4833552, 696718, 77192, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful :-) The fact that my girlfriend and I have been sitting here cooing over her for the last minute tells you something :-)<br/> <br/>The detail on her fur is lovely, love the B&amp;W, the focus, the negative space, and her eyes are captivating. 10!</td>', 'She''s beautiful :-) The fact that my girlfriend and I have been sitting here cooing over her for the last minute tells you something :-) The detail on her fur is lovely, love the B&W, the focus, the negative space, and her eyes are captivating. 10!', '2008-07-19 06:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833571, 696718, 47852, '<td valign="top">Adorable kitty!  It''s really tempting to just see a cute shot like this and click the 10 based on cuteness alone!  But, looking further at the shot, I love the way she''s tucked herself in that little space between the two items, and the diagonal lines which follow her gaze.  The b/w conversion is nicely done, with a full range of tones, and the dof is right on.  So, I guess it deserves that 10 for more than just the cuteness! :)</td>', 'Adorable kitty!  It''s really tempting to just see a cute shot like this and click the 10 based on cuteness alone!  But, looking further at the shot, I love the way she''s tucked herself in that little space between the two items, and the diagonal lines which follow her gaze.  The b/w conversion is nicely done, with a full range of tones, and the dof is right on.  So, I guess it deserves that 10 for more than just the cuteness! :)', '2008-07-19 07:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833575, 698741, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great symmetry and contrast here, and such a unique idea and composition.  I could get nitpicky about the elbow being cut off, the one set of clasped hands that is over the one shoulder, or the two girls wearing bracelets, but it just doesn''t seem to matter since it doesn''t really take away from the whole shot.  One of the few shots that I have gotten sucked into exploring so much, especially as these small resolutions for the web.  One of my top picks for the challenge.  Well done! :)</td>', 'Great symmetry and contrast here, and such a unique idea and composition.  I could get nitpicky about the elbow being cut off, the one set of clasped hands that is over the one shoulder, or the two girls wearing bracelets, but it just doesn''t seem to matter since it doesn''t really take away from the whole shot.  One of the few shots that I have gotten sucked into exploring so much, especially as these small resolutions for the web.  One of my top picks for the challenge.  Well done! :)', '2008-07-19 07:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833577, 698541, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit, I''m not a fan of all these monkey and gorilla shots that everyone enters in challenges.  I don''t know why.  I usually get to them, give a little grunt, try to vote on the technical merits of the shot and move along.  But something about this one actually made me smile and want to explore the shot a bit more.  Perhaps the symmetry in their hands and facial expressions, or the gaze straight into the camera from the elder?  I''m not sure, but this is probably one of the higher scores I''ve given to a shot of these subjects.  Nicely captured.</td>', 'I''ll admit, I''m not a fan of all these monkey and gorilla shots that everyone enters in challenges.  I don''t know why.  I usually get to them, give a little grunt, try to vote on the technical merits of the shot and move along.  But something about this one actually made me smile and want to explore the shot a bit more.  Perhaps the symmetry in their hands and facial expressions, or the gaze straight into the camera from the elder?  I''m not sure, but this is probably one of the higher scores I''ve given to a shot of these subjects.  Nicely captured.', '2008-07-19 07:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833578, 698840, 47852, '<td valign="top">Ah, what a risk putting a cute kid shot into a challenge!  But, I think you''ve managed to capture something more unique here that will hopefully appeal to the mass of voters.  You''ve captured a moment of a story, and I can just picture what else is going on in the room.  She looks happy, and that makes me smile, too.  The shallow dof is great, though I wish just a little deeper to get both eyes in sharp focus.  Looks like a fun moment, and a great memory for the family.</td>', 'Ah, what a risk putting a cute kid shot into a challenge!  But, I think you''ve managed to capture something more unique here that will hopefully appeal to the mass of voters.  You''ve captured a moment of a story, and I can just picture what else is going on in the room.  She looks happy, and that makes me smile, too.  The shallow dof is great, though I wish just a little deeper to get both eyes in sharp focus.  Looks like a fun moment, and a great memory for the family.', '2008-07-19 08:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833579, 698187, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the unique perspective here with the hat design filling in the space around her face.</td>', 'I like the unique perspective here with the hat design filling in the space around her face.', '2008-07-19 08:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
