(4833606, 698887, 55838, '<td valign="top">Lovely clean loon shot.  The one in the middle is clearly a show off!  This shot brings me pleasant reminders of my childhood days when we used to vacation on Lake Dore in Ontario.  What a spectacular sound when the loons were talking early in the misty morning.  Beatuful shot.  8</td>', 'Lovely clean loon shot.  The one in the middle is clearly a show off!  This shot brings me pleasant reminders of my childhood days when we used to vacation on Lake Dore in Ontario.  What a spectacular sound when the loons were talking early in the misty morning.  Beatuful shot.  8', '2008-07-19 09:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
