(4833925, 698829, 93883, '<td valign="top">Great focus on this one.  I like that you''ve maintained detail through the depth of the rose.  Has your background been achieved through a shallow DOF or post processing?  I''m not sure but I feel like it''s been blurred, good choice, but I think I''d like it even better if it were even more bokeh, but then again you may not have been able to maintain such focus on the rose with a lower aperture.  Too bad about the blown out part.  Nice use of contrasting colors too.</td>', 'Great focus on this one.  I like that you''ve maintained detail through the depth of the rose.  Has your background been achieved through a shallow DOF or post processing?  I''m not sure but I feel like it''s been blurred, good choice, but I think I''d like it even better if it were even more bokeh, but then again you may not have been able to maintain such focus on the rose with a lower aperture.  Too bad about the blown out part.  Nice use of contrasting colors too.', '2008-07-19 14:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
