(4833979, 698355, 93883, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I''m wondering how you got this lighting as I''m assuming it''s in a museum.  Love the composition and lighting, and I think black and white was a very good choice.</td>', 'Very nice, I''m wondering how you got this lighting as I''m assuming it''s in a museum.  Love the composition and lighting, and I think black and white was a very good choice.', '2008-07-19 15:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833981, 698683, 93883, '<td valign="top">Good use of a square crop and diagonal composition.  The rich color, clarity, and sharpness are also great.  I like this alot.  What kind of instrument is it?</td>', 'Good use of a square crop and diagonal composition.  The rich color, clarity, and sharpness are also great.  I like this alot.  What kind of instrument is it?', '2008-07-19 15:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833982, 698260, 93883, '<td valign="top">lol, very cute idea, and a thechnically good photo.</td>', 'lol, very cute idea, and a thechnically good photo.', '2008-07-19 15:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833983, 697503, 93883, '<td valign="top">often I don''t like this technique, but the desaturation works well here.  Good play on the black and white in color idea.</td>', 'often I don''t like this technique, but the desaturation works well here.  Good play on the black and white in color idea.', '2008-07-19 15:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833985, 696311, 93883, '<td valign="top">haha, I should really quit trying to vote while eating my lunch.  Great colors here, and both technically and compositionally strong.</td>', 'haha, I should really quit trying to vote while eating my lunch.  Great colors here, and both technically and compositionally strong.', '2008-07-19 15:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833991, 697597, 93883, '<td valign="top">Good makeup job.  I like the color choices and the lighting is perfect.</td>', 'Good makeup job.  I like the color choices and the lighting is perfect.', '2008-07-19 15:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833996, 698654, 93883, '<td valign="top">wow, provacative.  The pose, composition, and colors of this are great.  The only thing I''d like better is if the hard shadows by her arms and legs were gone.</td>', 'wow, provacative.  The pose, composition, and colors of this are great.  The only thing I''d like better is if the hard shadows by her arms and legs were gone.', '2008-07-19 15:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
