(4834444, 698938, 73998, '<td valign="top">Have you ever tried HDR?  This would''ve been a PERFECT place to use it.  The dynamic range of the church is too high for a single exposure.  While the detail in the windows is retained, the rest of the image is underexposed.</td>', 'Have you ever tried HDR?  This would''ve been a PERFECT place to use it.  The dynamic range of the church is too high for a single exposure.  While the detail in the windows is retained, the rest of the image is underexposed.', '2008-07-19 21:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
