(4834449, 698913, 73998, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Two things though.  One, I would''ve cropped this a little tighter, as I think there''s too much open space at the top of the image.  Two, the blurry object in the lower left corner is a little distracting, although that may have been unavoidable.  Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Two things though.  One, I would''ve cropped this a little tighter, as I think there''s too much open space at the top of the image.  Two, the blurry object in the lower left corner is a little distracting, although that may have been unavoidable.  Good job.', '2008-07-19 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
