(4835355, 698524, 68586, '<td valign="top">Really interesting shot, but perhaps a little busy for me as there seem to be a lot of things demanding the viewers attention - the man (obviously), the jets of water entering in from the left, the main fountain providing a backdrop . . and the water column of the main fountain, being a brighter point than the mans face tends to lead the eye away from his features and almost make him a ''bit'' player in a bigger picture.<br/> <br/>Lot''s of good things all bundled in here - but for me at least, this would be a stronger shot if there was a single clear focal point.</td>', 'Really interesting shot, but perhaps a little busy for me as there seem to be a lot of things demanding the viewers attention - the man (obviously), the jets of water entering in from the left, the main fountain providing a backdrop . . and the water column of the main fountain, being a brighter point than the mans face tends to lead the eye away from his features and almost make him a ''bit'' player in a bigger picture. Lot''s of good things all bundled in here - but for me at least, this would be a stronger shot if there was a single clear focal point.', '2008-07-20 17:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
