(4835706, 698654, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''m sure not many guys will notice, *grin*  but her knee is cut off.  Would be much better if she were ''whole''.   Good lighting.</td>', 'I''m sure not many guys will notice, *grin*  but her knee is cut off.  Would be much better if she were ''whole''.   Good lighting.', '2008-07-20 21:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
