(4835720, 698901, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fascinating!  I really like the colors and textures and patterns.  I wish the center were more focused.</td>', 'Fascinating!  I really like the colors and textures and patterns.  I wish the center were more focused.', '2008-07-20 21:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4835725, 698852, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I would have cropped a bit off the top, to bring the baby''s hand centered up in the frame.<br/>Lovely detail and processing.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I would have cropped a bit off the top, to bring the baby''s hand centered up in the frame.Lovely detail and processing.', '2008-07-20 21:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4835735, 696393, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, interest, and sharpness.  The reflection in the body almost gives a motion feel.  Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, interest, and sharpness.  The reflection in the body almost gives a motion feel.  Well done.', '2008-07-20 21:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4835738, 698864, 86447, '<td valign="top">Isn''t Kay Kay ADORABLE?!   :)   (yes)<br/>I like the colors... just a Happy Photo.   :)<br/> <br/>Good eye focus on her right eye... could be a tad sharper on her left to be perfect.   But, with this image, perfect isn''t required in order to make me smile right back at Kay Kay.</td>', 'Isn''t Kay Kay ADORABLE?!   :)   (yes)I like the colors... just a Happy Photo.   :) Good eye focus on her right eye... could be a tad sharper on her left to be perfect.   But, with this image, perfect isn''t required in order to make me smile right back at Kay Kay.', '2008-07-20 21:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4835742, 697398, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I really like the field of flowers.  I''d get a new Hair Artist for your next shot, though.  *grin*</td>', 'Beautiful!  I really like the field of flowers.  I''d get a new Hair Artist for your next shot, though.  *grin*', '2008-07-20 21:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4835804, 698864, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the intimacy and angle of the portrait, but I also find the OOF earrings a slight distraction, drawing the viewer away from the eyes -- I''d like to see this with them either cropped or cloned away.</td>', 'I like the intimacy and angle of the portrait, but I also find the OOF earrings a slight distraction, drawing the viewer away from the eyes -- I''d like to see this with them either cropped or cloned away.', '2008-07-20 21:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4835813, 698666, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting and processing remind me of old Dutch oil paintings -- suitable for the mood and emotion you are trying to convey.</td>', 'Lighting and processing remind me of old Dutch oil paintings -- suitable for the mood and emotion you are trying to convey.', '2008-07-20 22:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4835838, 698859, 1031, '<td valign="top">My somewhat older son <a href="//dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=2721" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Isaac</a> is soon to be placed in the same position, playing (the clarinet) for real. Looks like great fun, but don''t forget the ear protection.</td>', 'My somewhat older son Isaac is soon to be placed in the same position, playing (the clarinet) for real. Looks like great fun, but don''t forget the ear protection.', '2008-07-20 22:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
