(4836333, 698168, 28742, '<td valign="top">I''ll tell ya what I think of it - - - Spectacular! Really a great portrait. Color and DoF ROCK here. GREAT work!</td>', 'I''ll tell ya what I think of it - - - Spectacular! Really a great portrait. Color and DoF ROCK here. GREAT work!', '2008-07-21 03:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836334, 698081, 28742, '<td valign="top">Yikes! Get that highly sharp, very detailed, creepy thing outta my face! :) Awesome macro, Roz! Tough competition in this psuedo-free-study. Solid score though.</td>', 'Yikes! Get that highly sharp, very detailed, creepy thing outta my face! :) Awesome macro, Roz! Tough competition in this psuedo-free-study. Solid score though.', '2008-07-21 03:57:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836335, 698472, 28742, '<td valign="top">You exceeded your scoring expectations and a 3rd place personal best - congrats, Jeffrey! Great job!! And you look exactly how I pictured you. :P</td>', 'You exceeded your scoring expectations and a 3rd place personal best - congrats, Jeffrey! Great job!! And you look exactly how I pictured you. :P', '2008-07-21 04:00:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836336, 698527, 28742, '<td valign="top">Stop trying to milk the bug shots! ;-P<br/>Nice job, David. Could use a wider DoF / more focus maybe, but still scored pretty decent.</td>', 'Stop trying to milk the bug shots! ;-PNice job, David. Could use a wider DoF / more focus maybe, but still scored pretty decent.', '2008-07-21 04:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836337, 698884, 68504, '<td valign="top">Very fine. The form of the fowl just emerges, nothing else.</td>', 'Very fine. The form of the fowl just emerges, nothing else.', '2008-07-21 04:03:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836338, 698733, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wow - this really conveys! Seems like a young bulimic/anorexic girl going through her daily routine of body picking and self hate, but maybe I am misinterpreting. Nice work though, Kari.<br/> <br/><i>edit:</i> Just read your notes - whaddya know! :P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-21 03:05:47.</i></td>', 'Wow - this really conveys! Seems like a young bulimic/anorexic girl going through her daily routine of body picking and self hate, but maybe I am misinterpreting. Nice work though, Kari. edit: Just read your notes - whaddya know! :P', '2008-07-21 04:05:07.000000', '2008-07-21 04:05:47.000000', 0),
(4836340, 698847, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very clever, Frank! Worked very well. Great detail!</td>', 'Very clever, Frank! Worked very well. Great detail!', '2008-07-21 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836341, 698735, 68504, '<td valign="top">The detail on the calyx, the limited palette serve very well to make this a composition and and not just a bee macro, though he is certainly doing his part.</td>', 'The detail on the calyx, the limited palette serve very well to make this a composition and and not just a bee macro, though he is certainly doing his part.', '2008-07-21 04:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836343, 697597, 28742, '<td valign="top">Ooh- looks like your hair color is slightly conagious, Judi. ;-)<br/>Not sure what happened to this in the challenge - maybe just lacks impact - partly beacause of the lack of expression. Whaddo I know. I like it though.</td>', 'Ooh- looks like your hair color is slightly conagious, Judi. ;-)Not sure what happened to this in the challenge - maybe just lacks impact - partly beacause of the lack of expression. Whaddo I know. I like it though.', '2008-07-21 04:11:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836347, 698366, 28742, '<td valign="top">Funny - succeeded! LOL! Could probably only be improved by the addition of a small frog in your mouth. :P</td>', 'Funny - succeeded! LOL! Could probably only be improved by the addition of a small frog in your mouth. :P', '2008-07-21 04:14:41.000000', NULL, 0),
