(4836351, 698614, 52549, '<td valign="top">You had a break and you''re still doing great, hope to follow your lead ;-) Best wishes to you both and I hope you had a wonderful holiday. Btw, great shot, the title fits perfectly.</td>', 'You had a break and you''re still doing great, hope to follow your lead ;-) Best wishes to you both and I hope you had a wonderful holiday. Btw, great shot, the title fits perfectly.', '2008-07-21 04:19:58.000000', NULL, 0),
