(4836366, 698781, 70514, '<td valign="top">I really like how the spire touches the slight break in the clouds.  The color and clarity is beautiful.</td>', 'I really like how the spire touches the slight break in the clouds.  The color and clarity is beautiful.', '2008-07-21 04:31:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836367, 698076, 28742, '<td valign="top">A bit optimistic in your prediction there, huh Charlie? ;-)</td>', 'A bit optimistic in your prediction there, huh Charlie? ;-)', '2008-07-21 04:32:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836371, 698541, 34938, '<td valign="top">Daniel, I just realised this was taken at Singapore Zoo...what a great place. I visited the Night Safari last year. It was a lot of fun. The light and composition are fantastic...well done on your first blue! Three cheers for SINGAPORE! <br/></td>', 'Daniel, I just realised this was taken at Singapore Zoo...what a great place. I visited the Night Safari last year. It was a lot of fun. The light and composition are fantastic...well done on your first blue! Three cheers for SINGAPORE! ', '2008-07-21 04:39:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836372, 698201, 28962, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SoulMan1978:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m wondering whether you held the slinky in place somehow before shooting or caught it in motion? if the latter well done indeed </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, it was standing on the table.. Still not that easy to keep it where it was, but no motion..</td>', 'Originally posted by SoulMan1978: I''m wondering whether you held the slinky in place somehow before shooting or caught it in motion? if the latter well done indeed   No, it was standing on the table.. Still not that easy to keep it where it was, but no motion..', '2008-07-21 04:39:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836373, 698201, 28962, '<td valign="top">Thanks all..</td>', 'Thanks all..', '2008-07-21 04:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836378, 698444, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love seeing the way you see things.  Thanks for this!</td>', 'I love seeing the way you see things.  Thanks for this!', '2008-07-21 04:57:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836385, 698541, 2158, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  This is one of my alltime favourite animal photos.</td>', 'Congratulations.  This is one of my alltime favourite animal photos.', '2008-07-21 05:14:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836387, 698938, 35545, '<td valign="top">Oh, dear!  It looks as if you fell victim to the Tack Sharp Syndrome -- the widely held misconception that only shots that are "tack sharp" are worthy of a high score.  You''ve got great leading lines, and IMNSHO, the soft focus gives a lovely, moody feeling to the shot.</td>', 'Oh, dear!  It looks as if you fell victim to the Tack Sharp Syndrome -- the widely held misconception that only shots that are "tack sharp" are worthy of a high score.  You''ve got great leading lines, and IMNSHO, the soft focus gives a lovely, moody feeling to the shot.', '2008-07-21 05:22:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836391, 698668, 65035, '<td valign="top">Svetlana how wonderful to see you back and with such a magic image!<br/></td>', 'Svetlana how wonderful to see you back and with such a magic image!', '2008-07-21 05:37:13.000000', NULL, 0),
