(4836716, 698355, 77287, '<td valign="top">Many thanks for that heavyj. It''s most appreciated.<br/> <br/>As you can see from the shutter speed and ISO, this was in a very dark room. (Imperial War Museum)<br/>It was taken hand held. (tripods not allowed) The guy in the spotlight is a security guard (sorry sempermarine - I preferred your version)<br/>He did not know I was taking the shot. The lady on the bench behind is simply a visitor resting her legs.<br/>All I did was darken the surrounding areas ans burn out anything distracting including the stand the jet was on.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>Bob</td>', 'Many thanks for that heavyj. It''s most appreciated. As you can see from the shutter speed and ISO, this was in a very dark room. (Imperial War Museum)It was taken hand held. (tripods not allowed) The guy in the spotlight is a security guard (sorry sempermarine - I preferred your version)He did not know I was taking the shot. The lady on the bench behind is simply a visitor resting her legs.All I did was darken the surrounding areas ans burn out anything distracting including the stand the jet was on. CheersBob', '2008-07-21 11:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4836723, 698615, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ann:</b></div><hr/><i> Very cool. This didn''t come up for me in voting. If I had, you probably would have beat me, because you would have gotten another 10. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I had 7.0165 around 11 p.m. just before I went to bed last night, but by this morning at 6 a.m. (rollover time in Germany) it was down to 6.9. No problem. I''m happy with my score and placing, and pleased for you that your image did so well.</td>', 'Originally posted by Ann: Very cool. This didn''t come up for me in voting. If I had, you probably would have beat me, because you would have gotten another 10.  I had 7.0165 around 11 p.m. just before I went to bed last night, but by this morning at 6 a.m. (rollover time in Germany) it was down to 6.9. No problem. I''m happy with my score and placing, and pleased for you that your image did so well.', '2008-07-21 11:41:58.000000', NULL, 0),
