(4836966, 698856, 67152, '<td valign="top">an unusual and seemingly uncomfortable pose, the stretched neck, the unsymmetrical placement of the necklace, the fact that we can see ''up her nose'', the seemingly odd crop at her bustline - all create difficulty to the 5 second viewer. <br/> <br/>She''s a very pretty model, photographed well - good light, contrast etc. - but I think many including myself have a hard time ''seeing it'' in this pose and choice of upside down. <br/></td>', 'an unusual and seemingly uncomfortable pose, the stretched neck, the unsymmetrical placement of the necklace, the fact that we can see ''up her nose'', the seemingly odd crop at her bustline - all create difficulty to the 5 second viewer.  She''s a very pretty model, photographed well - good light, contrast etc. - but I think many including myself have a hard time ''seeing it'' in this pose and choice of upside down. ', '2008-07-21 14:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
