(4837451, 698900, 51538, '<td valign="top">Having fun with the new cam?  Isn''t that little wheel thingy good.  I used to be able to use my 350XT in the dark, could do anything with it as regards the buttons etc.  It was second nature.  But along came a new cam with that wheel thing and I have lost the ability to do press the right buttons on the 350XT....  I like the controls on the D models and the quality of the sensor too.  The 50mm f/1.4 is worth buying when you get a few pennies together.  BTW, really nice photo this one.</td>', 'Having fun with the new cam?  Isn''t that little wheel thingy good.  I used to be able to use my 350XT in the dark, could do anything with it as regards the buttons etc.  It was second nature.  But along came a new cam with that wheel thing and I have lost the ability to do press the right buttons on the 350XT....  I like the controls on the D models and the quality of the sensor too.  The 50mm f/1.4 is worth buying when you get a few pennies together.  BTW, really nice photo this one.', '2008-07-21 19:37:04.000000', NULL, 0),
