(4838154, 698514, 89341, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=697253" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697253.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697253.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697253.gif"/></a> from me in <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=797556" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a> <br/> <br/>I love the simplicity in this beautiful shot, the patterns and textures are fantastic and the bright background is excellent.</td>', ' from me in Posthumous Ribbons  I love the simplicity in this beautiful shot, the patterns and textures are fantastic and the bright background is excellent.', '2008-07-22 07:58:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4838155, 698671, 89341, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=697251" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697251.gif"/></a> from me in <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=797556" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a> <br/> <br/>I love the tones and the dof, combined with the sharpness and detail in the tip of the rose</td>', ' from me in Posthumous Ribbons  I love the tones and the dof, combined with the sharpness and detail in the tip of the rose', '2008-07-22 07:59:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4838157, 698901, 89341, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=697252" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/697252.gif"/></a> from me in <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=797556" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons</a> <br/> <br/>This is so cool, I love the colours from the jelly, had no idea during the challenge what the green was but guessed the mushroom. There is so much to look at in this with the detail in the mushroom and the air bubbles. As someone else mentioned I could also see this as a poster.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-22 07:02:21.</i></td>', ' from me in Posthumous Ribbons  This is so cool, I love the colours from the jelly, had no idea during the challenge what the green was but guessed the mushroom. There is so much to look at in this with the detail in the mushroom and the air bubbles. As someone else mentioned I could also see this as a poster.', '2008-07-22 08:01:27.000000', '2008-07-22 08:02:21.000000', 0),
(4838197, 698446, 52549, '<td valign="top">I really like this portrait and feel that it''s underrated scorewise. I''m no expert on portraits but I think <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=92859" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">americandream</a> nailed it in saying the eyes should have been brighter. It would have made a BIG difference to the overall effect. Still very good work and your Dad''s very photogenic.</td>', 'I really like this portrait and feel that it''s underrated scorewise. I''m no expert on portraits but I think  americandream nailed it in saying the eyes should have been brighter. It would have made a BIG difference to the overall effect. Still very good work and your Dad''s very photogenic.', '2008-07-22 08:50:03.000000', NULL, 0),
