(4838865, 698444, 67145, '<td valign="top">brilliant .. love the weirdness of this . .. <br/>love that guy''s long pants all crumpled .. and the dramatic sky all blown out .. !!<br/>if he looked around i''d expect a black mo &amp; i bet he''d walk in a funny waddling sort''v way .. !!<br/>congratulations on your ribbon .. <br/>its a fantastic photograph, a well thought out idea and i love the sepia process ... <br/>you do these set-up shots so well .. i wish i had half your talent .. :)<br/></td>', 'brilliant .. love the weirdness of this . .. love that guy''s long pants all crumpled .. and the dramatic sky all blown out .. !!if he looked around i''d expect a black mo & i bet he''d walk in a funny waddling sort''v way .. !!congratulations on your ribbon .. its a fantastic photograph, a well thought out idea and i love the sepia process ... you do these set-up shots so well .. i wish i had half your talent .. :)', '2008-07-22 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4839326, 698109, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot; I mean there are a lot of people on this site who can take a creative and excellent portrait, but the subject has a blank or wrong expression. In this shot- you prove that all is not lost- you coaxed a terrific expression and fantastically knowledgeable and intriguing look out of your model.</td>', 'Excellent shot; I mean there are a lot of people on this site who can take a creative and excellent portrait, but the subject has a blank or wrong expression. In this shot- you prove that all is not lost- you coaxed a terrific expression and fantastically knowledgeable and intriguing look out of your model.', '2008-07-22 22:14:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4839387, 696422, 32345, '<td valign="top">A beautiful macro with great colors, congrats for the ribbon :)</td>', 'A beautiful macro with great colors, congrats for the ribbon :)', '2008-07-22 22:37:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4839550, 698685, 75386, '<td valign="top">D&amp;B?!<br/> <br/>Great photo, the repetition, especially of the light through the arches is wonderful</td>', 'D&B?! Great photo, the repetition, especially of the light through the arches is wonderful', '2008-07-22 23:53:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4839608, 698836, 60862, '<td valign="top">LOL.  First, thanks for giving me a new term to look up: zone plate.<br/> <br/>Maybe I''m cutting you slack because I know much of your imagery and I like it, and I know you know full well what you''re doing.  I can''t swear I''d vote this highly.  However, now I don''t need to bother separating out what I know, so I''ll just say it''s a fun image and it captures a cat''s "science" perfectly. :)<br/> <br/>And congrats on a 2.6+ difference in score between avg. and commenters, <b>especially</b> since that includes a couple of commenters who clearly didn''t like it!</td>', 'LOL.  First, thanks for giving me a new term to look up: zone plate. Maybe I''m cutting you slack because I know much of your imagery and I like it, and I know you know full well what you''re doing.  I can''t swear I''d vote this highly.  However, now I don''t need to bother separating out what I know, so I''ll just say it''s a fun image and it captures a cat''s "science" perfectly. :) And congrats on a 2.6+ difference in score between avg. and commenters, especially since that includes a couple of commenters who clearly didn''t like it!', '2008-07-23 00:22:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4839720, 698654, 38032, '<td valign="top">I was trying to stop drooling long enough to find something about this i didn''t like.<br/>Her fingernails are a weird color.<br/>I love the movie reference and the photo is simply jaw-dropping.</td>', 'I was trying to stop drooling long enough to find something about this i didn''t like.Her fingernails are a weird color.I love the movie reference and the photo is simply jaw-dropping.', '2008-07-23 00:50:15.000000', NULL, 0),
