(4871956, 698735, 60862, '<td valign="top">WOW.  Your first macro attempt?  Sheesh!  I''ve been at it for more than a year, and I still haven''t captured anything as good as this.  I mean, the hairs on top actually look soft, like I''d like to run my fingers through them.  Looks like another type of photography is yours to master, Sandy. :)</td>', 'WOW.  Your first macro attempt?  Sheesh!  I''ve been at it for more than a year, and I still haven''t captured anything as good as this.  I mean, the hairs on top actually look soft, like I''d like to run my fingers through them.  Looks like another type of photography is yours to master, Sandy. :)', '2008-08-07 01:52:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4874355, 696996, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, with something a little out of the ordinary.  I would never have known it was taken indoors - you''ve done a great job with the light.  I remember a year or so back when you changed your username, and the reasons behind it.  Well, it has paid off - you have certainly learnt to use the light very well!  :)</td>', 'Nice portrait, with something a little out of the ordinary.  I would never have known it was taken indoors - you''ve done a great job with the light.  I remember a year or so back when you changed your username, and the reasons behind it.  Well, it has paid off - you have certainly learnt to use the light very well!  :)', '2008-08-08 02:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
