(4876900, 698869, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is more like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50641" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">skewsme</a> shot.  I think she is rubbing off on you.  :)  I love the focus and clarity and DOF.  Very clever scene.</td>', 'This is more like a  skewsme shot.  I think she is rubbing off on you.  :)  I love the focus and clarity and DOF.  Very clever scene.', '2008-08-09 10:31:19.000000', NULL, 0),
