(4885542, 698903, 42495, '<td valign="top">I just saw this in your portfolio and it''s certainly a cool picture and the dq sucks.  I think the dq is due to the glow  that the fractalius gave around the cup.  If you look at the rim right above the handle, it has some tiny "fingers" that weren''t there in the original.  This is just a guess, of course.<br/> <br/>As far as using fractalius, it may be possible to use very subtlety to enhance what''s already there, but not add anything.</td>', 'I just saw this in your portfolio and it''s certainly a cool picture and the dq sucks.  I think the dq is due to the glow  that the fractalius gave around the cup.  If you look at the rim right above the handle, it has some tiny "fingers" that weren''t there in the original.  This is just a guess, of course. As far as using fractalius, it may be possible to use very subtlety to enhance what''s already there, but not add anything.', '2008-08-13 11:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
